    Register the folded parameter members in the own group
    
    The own proximity group now carries the same physical parameter claim members
    as the shared group: the same roots and runtime trees, registered by physical
    identity, with their sample rows built from the same claim message. The tree
    source rebuilds the folded message tree from the norm witness and checks the
    plan and the root. The member and row counts stay member derived; the fixture
    budgets accommodate the reuse, so the claim object is available to the own
    group without a second commitment.
    
    partial progress

